<mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.25;color:#1F2A44&quot;&gt;Terminal thật cho CLI agent&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;font-weight:normal;line-height:1.4;color:#1F2A44;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Agent chạy trong terminal chia ô: README gọi&lt;br&gt;là terminal cùng đẳng cấp Ghostty&lt;br&gt;(Ghostty-class), vẽ bằng WebGL, chia ô không&lt;br&gt;giới hạn, scrollback còn sau khi mở lại.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFD9CF;strokeColor=#0B1B3A;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=22;spacingLeft=94;spacingRight=22;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="1117" width="520" height="176" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
